.TH INSTALL-TUI 1 "September 2026" "Peios" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
install-tui \- terminal surface for the Peios installer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B install-tui
.RB [ --socket " " PATH ]
.RB [ --kind " " NAME ]
.RB [ --plain ]
.RB [ --size " " COLSxROWS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B install-tui
renders the installation conversation owned by
.BR installerd (8).
Closing the surface does not stop an installation already in progress; a new
surface can attach to the same conversation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --socket " PATH"
Connect to PATH instead of
.IR /run/installerd.sock .
.TP
.BI --kind " NAME"
Request an MSIP kind other than
.BR install .
.TP
.B --plain
Use the conservative serial-console presentation.
.TP
.BI --size " COLSxROWS"
Override terminal geometry.  Both dimensions must be non-zero.
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Show command help.
.TP
.BR -V , " --version"
Show the program version.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR installerd (8),
.BR msip-drive (1)
